{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987690/extras/87eb49389bb7ea6d74f882b743eaac5f.webp?t=1770176400\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br>Super Sushi Roll is a 2D roll-a-ball platformer where you control platforms and launch sushi to dinner plates. Master the mechanics, mind the time limit, unlock new sushi rolls, and search for hidden collectibles! A short game with speedrunning potential.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987690/extras/9951989443ed2c5cae3b552301376335.webp?t=1770176400\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Wood Kitchen - A beginner stage introducing the chopsticks and platform controls. Watch out for knives!<br></li><li>Bamboo Forest - Introduces pinball-like bumpers and trapdoors. It's easy to get lost in the forest.<br></li><li>Ink Painting - Uncover the secrets of spirits and serve ghost sushi.<br></li><li>Sky Temple - Learn the ancient ways of gravity modification in this advanced stage.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987690/extras/98684d34efb589b388d61a091c00564e.webp?t=1770176400\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic - Choose an area and complete each level within the time limit.<br></li><li>Training - View level stats and hunt for dessert with infinite sushi.<br></li><li>Buffet Challenge - Play through each area with no extra sushi offered.<br></li><li>Dessert Challenge - Two out of three desserts are required before progressing to the next level.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987690/extras/bff26913a32ea5684b09f3761147ba46.webp?t=1770176400\" width=600 height=51 /></span><br><ul class=\"b